{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Snow Resort Simulator</i>. Tackle daily responsibilities: upgrade facilities, maintain a cozy resort, satisfy guests with freshly cooked meals and drinks. Be prepared for the challenges that come with winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/e15d24007a4ae8d811a2ace446f79e99.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/77212c907e4b0074c49038b28af0b832.poster.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/77212c907e4b0074c49038b28af0b832.webm?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/77212c907e4b0074c49038b28af0b832.mp4?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure you prepare tickets according to customer requests. Sell tickets to customers who want to ski. Use the income to improve your resort and restock supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/f5ce8f231d50d61e72c0ab9934abc7c4.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/1d791f93349373abc998a51398b30bdf.poster.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/1d791f93349373abc998a51398b30bdf.webm?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/1d791f93349373abc998a51398b30bdf.mp4?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will visit your shop to have damaged items fixed and buy new equipment. Repair ski equipment according to customer needs to help them out. Use the income to upgrade your shop, which will allow you to provide more services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/78594f87289fbd6a1e5aa0504513eaa2.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/8599d8d5ae52888bb141ac2b636823ba.poster.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/8599d8d5ae52888bb141ac2b636823ba.webm?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/8599d8d5ae52888bb141ac2b636823ba.mp4?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To operate the caf\u00e9 efficiently and increase your profits, respond quickly and accurately to customer orders. Prepare and deliver food according to customer preferences. Clear the tables to make space for new customers. Ensure all equipment is functional. Upgrade your caf\u00e9, buy new equipment, and tables to serve more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/002bb5203a32d3c1722db30108c05cde.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.poster.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.webm?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.mp4?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the hotel to have new rooms and rent them out. After guests check out, clean and tidy up the rooms. New customers will not want to stay because of messy rooms.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299080?t=1773662279","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/879da16ac008729bfd263382b5335e12b248116f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773662279","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/247dc6114c4074d2785a429f3330753d75de4dd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773662279","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/247dc6114c4074d2785a429f3330753d75de4dd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773662279","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4060280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Be part of our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/85b711b7cfd83cd6c26d869d76319abd.avif?t=1773662279\" width=780 height=208 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Snow Resort Simulator</i>. Tackle daily responsibilities: upgrade facilities, maintain a cozy resort, satisfy guests with freshly cooked meals and drinks. Be prepared for the challenges that come with winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/e15d24007a4ae8d811a2ace446f79e99.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/77212c907e4b0074c49038b28af0b832.poster.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/77212c907e4b0074c49038b28af0b832.webm?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/77212c907e4b0074c49038b28af0b832.mp4?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure you prepare tickets according to customer requests. Sell tickets to customers who want to ski. Use the income to improve your resort and restock supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/f5ce8f231d50d61e72c0ab9934abc7c4.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/1d791f93349373abc998a51398b30bdf.poster.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/1d791f93349373abc998a51398b30bdf.webm?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/1d791f93349373abc998a51398b30bdf.mp4?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will visit your shop to have damaged items fixed and buy new equipment. Repair ski equipment according to customer needs to help them out. Use the income to upgrade your shop, which will allow you to provide more services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/78594f87289fbd6a1e5aa0504513eaa2.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/8599d8d5ae52888bb141ac2b636823ba.poster.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/8599d8d5ae52888bb141ac2b636823ba.webm?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/8599d8d5ae52888bb141ac2b636823ba.mp4?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To operate the caf\u00e9 efficiently and increase your profits, respond quickly and accurately to customer orders. Prepare and deliver food according to customer preferences. Clear the tables to make space for new customers. Ensure all equipment is functional. Upgrade your caf\u00e9, buy new equipment, and tables to serve more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/002bb5203a32d3c1722db30108c05cde.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.poster.avif?t=1773662279\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.webm?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.mp4?t=1773662279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the hotel to have new rooms and rent them out. After guests check out, clean and tidy up the rooms. New customers will not want to stay because of messy rooms.</p>","developers":["Vovel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299080/d642840c6e3f5d6fe5e07c70e17ac3a3e840f6cf/header.jpg?t=1773662279","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 | Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB av